\[\lim_{n \rightarrow+\infty}\frac{\int_{0}^{1}(1-x^{2})^{n}\,dx}{\int_{0}^{\frac{1}{2}}\left(1-x^{2}\right)^{n} dx}, \quad 
\lim_{n \rightarrow+\infty}\frac{\int_{0}^{1}(1-x^{2})^{n}\,dx}{\int_{0}^{1}\big(1-\frac{x^{2}}{2023}\big)^{n}\,dx}, \quad 
